 "notes": [
  "Total 60 as published (headers 13/21/9/11/6; trailing numbers are quantities: 'Abbysin 12', 'Dagobah Cave 2', etc.).",
  "No Objective. The strategy says 'You start Jabba's Palace + JP audience ch. using combat readiness', so Tatooine: Jabba's Palace is the starting card and Combat Readiness the starting Interrupt.",
  "The post ends 'OOPS Nalan Cheel should be Chal Beckan'; Nalan Cheel is a Light card, so the line is dested to the card he meant, Chall Bekan.",
  "'Beelo' could be Boelo or Beedo (both Dark Jabba's Palace-era aliens, one letter off each): kept as posted (UNKNOWN).",
  "Posted 'Abbysin' dested Abyssin; 'Jabba' the Special Edition character; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Banguus Glee' Brangus Glee; 'Galid' Gailid; 'Wounded Wookie' Wounded Wookiee; 'Abyssin Orn' Abyssin Ornament; 'Zuckuss'/'Bossk' the Dagobah characters; 'IG in IG 2000' IG-88 In IG-2000. Secret Plans is the Special Edition Effect (April 2000; Defensive Shields came later)."
